SCOPE

This MIT licence covers the files authored for this repository: the scripts in
tools/, the documentation in docs/ and the root of the repository, and the
workflow JSON in automations/ that was written here.

It does NOT cover:

  * knowledge-base/ content derived from the n8n documentation, which is
    published under the n8n Sustainable Use License v1.0;
